# Keep local credentials out of the build context at every depth.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/.envrc
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.git-credentials
**/.aws
**/.azure
**/.config/gcloud
**/.docker/config.json
**/.ssh
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/*private*key*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.kdbx
**/credentials*.json
**/secrets*.json
**/secrets*.toml
**/secrets*.yaml
**/secrets*.yml
**/config.local.*
**/config.private.*

# These are reviewed public/provenance inputs, never private-key locations.
!tools/windows_portable/update_public_key.xml
!tools/windows_portable/release-runtime-files.json
